    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;MOMO Bunny's Super Chat Strike!!&quot; \ud83d\udc30\ud83d\udcb8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary mercenary MOMO Bunny was enjoying retirement until a Colonel suddenly appeared:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\u2708\ufe0f &quot;Help! My team's been captured!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc30 &quot;Sure... but let me livestream it!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And thus begins a rescue mission with a twist - every saved teammate becomes a Super Chat donor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd4b FIGHTING GAME STYLE SPECIAL MOVES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pull off flashy moves with command inputs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 TEAM UP WITH RESCUES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use rescued allies for special moves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- But don't overuse them - they might leave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 SUPER CHAT IS LIFE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rescued allies send Super Chats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect enough to enter Super Tension Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd85 BEWARE OF AERIAL PREDATORS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dodge bird attacks while entertaining viewers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Chat might warn: &quot;They're after those thighs!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa5 REALISTIC STREAM CHAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Live comments affect your performance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- &quot;Nice move!&quot; &quot;What were you thinking!?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique action game where Super Chats fuel your fight! Can you become the legendary mercenary streamer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;No Super Chat? Then it's CHARGE TIME!!&quot; \ud83d\udd25</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;MOMO Bunny's Super Chat Strike!!&quot; \ud83d\udc30\ud83d\udcb8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary mercenary MOMO Bunny was enjoying retirement until a Colonel suddenly appeared:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\u2708\ufe0f &quot;Help! My team's been captured!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc30 &quot;Sure... but let me livestream it!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And thus begins a rescue mission with a twist - every saved teammate becomes a Super Chat donor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd4b FIGHTING GAME STYLE SPECIAL MOVES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pull off flashy moves with command inputs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 TEAM UP WITH RESCUES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use rescued allies for special moves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- But don't overuse them - they might leave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 SUPER CHAT IS LIFE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rescued allies send Super Chats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect enough to enter Super Tension Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd85 BEWARE OF AERIAL PREDATORS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dodge bird attacks while entertaining viewers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Chat might warn: &quot;They're after those thighs!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa5 REALISTIC STREAM CHAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Live comments affect your performance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- &quot;Nice move!&quot; &quot;What were you thinking!?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique action game where Super Chats fuel your fight! Can you become the legendary mercenary streamer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;No Super Chat? Then it's CHARGE TIME!!&quot; \ud83d\udd25</p>",
